    {
      "paper_id": "doi:10.1016/j.jet.2026.106216",
      "sequence": 7,
      "source_sequence": 7,
      "article_type": "research-article",
      "title_en": "Minimum price equilibrium in the assignment market: Structural properties and the Serial Vickrey mechanism",
      "title_cn": "转让市场的最低价格均衡：结构特性和串行维克里机制",
      "authors": [
        "Yu Zhou",
        "Shigehiro Serizawa"
      ],
      "abstract_en": "We study an assignment market where multiple heterogenous objects are sold to unit demand agents who have general preferences that accommodate income effects and market frictions. The minimum price equilibrium (MPE) is one of the most important equilibrium concepts in such settings. Nevertheless, none of the well-known mechanisms that find the MPE in the quasi-linear settings can identify or even approximate MPEs for general preferences. We establish novel structural properties of MPEs and use them as bases to design a \"Serial Vickrey (SV) mechanism.\" The SV mechanism finds an MPE for general preferences in a finite number of steps and only requires agents to reveal finite-dimensional information regarding their preferences in finitely many times. Besides, the SV mechanism also has nice incentive properties.",
      "abstract_cn": "我们研究了一个分配市场，其中多个异质对象被出售给单位需求代理，这些代理具有适应收入影响和市场摩擦的一般偏好。最低价格均衡（MPE）是这种情况下最重要的均衡概念之一。然而，在准线性设置中找到 MPE 的众所周知的机制都无法识别甚至近似一般偏好的 MPE。我们建立了 MPE 的新颖结构特性，并以此为基础设计“串行维克里 (SV) 机构”。 SV 机制在有限数量的步骤中找到一般偏好的 MPE，并且只需要代理在有限多次中揭示有关其偏好的有限维信息。此外，SV机制还具有良好的激励特性。",
      "abstract_snippet_en": "",
      "doi": "10.1016/j.jet.2026.106216",
      "source_url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0022053126000797?dgcid=rss_sd_all",
